/P 61 0 R
/E (Embedded Hardware Design Engineer with 4+ years of experience spanning schematic design, multilayer PCB layout, and embedded systems development for industrial, IoT, wearable, and consumer electronics products. Proven expertise in power electronics architecture DC-DC conversion, battery management systems \(BMS\), and power-path switching alongside RF front-end design and ATEX/IECEx-compliant hardware for hazardous-area applications. Proficient in Altium Designer and KiCad for high speed, impedance-controlled, multilayer board design, with hands-on experience in MCU bring-up, hardware-in-the-loop \(HIL\) validation, and EMI/EMC mitigation. Holds a Bachelor of Science in Engineering Sciences \(Optoelectronics\) from GIKI. Skilled at translating client and product requirements into reliable, manufacturable, production ready hardware from concept through certification.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [13]
>>
